v1.0.55: replace inline picker with Cupertino sheet picker

Inline picker (expand-collapse in form) stutters on real devices
even after 10+ build attempts — root cause is the picker
rebuilding inside a scrollable CupertinoListSection during animation,
overlapping with parent setState on every tick.

New pattern: tap row -> showCupertinoModalPopup opens a Cupertino
bottom sheet with the CupertinoPicker / CupertinoDatePicker. Done
button commits. The picker renders in a separate overlay route with
its own layer, so it never competes with the parent scroll form for
GPU. The original modal does not rebuild while the picker is open.

This is the same UX pattern Apple uses in iOS Settings, Calendar,
Reminders. Apple HIG compliant. Implemented as showSheetPicker<T>
and showSheetDatePicker in lib/core/widgets/sheet_picker.dart.

Replaced:
- 4 call sites: manual_booking_modal (Kostum, Tgl Mulai, Tgl Selesai,
  Keperluan), installment_list_screen (Jatuh tempo),
  add_costume_sheet (Ukuran).
- Old inline_picker_row.dart removed.

